# Empire Trajectory Skill

Track all compound assets. Enforce staircase progression. Dashboard gap to $50K/mo.

## Commands

### Asset Registry
```bash
python .claude/skills/business/empire-trajectory/scripts/asset-registry-cli.py add \
  --name "Product X" --category revenue --value 5000 --mrr 500
python .claude/skills/business/empire-trajectory/scripts/asset-registry-cli.py list
python .claude/skills/business/empire-trajectory/scripts/asset-registry-cli.py list --category revenue
python .claude/skills/business/empire-trajectory/scripts/asset-registry-cli.py update --id 1 --mrr 750
python .claude/skills/business/empire-trajectory/scripts/asset-registry-cli.py delete --id 1
python .claude/skills/business/empire-trajectory/scripts/asset-registry-cli.py summary
python .claude/skills/business/empire-trajectory/scripts/asset-registry-cli.py summary --json
```

### Staircase Enforcer
```bash
python .claude/skills/business/empire-trajectory/scripts/staircase-enforcer.py status
python .claude/skills/business/empire-trajectory/scripts/staircase-enforcer.py check --verdict PASS
python .claude/skills/business/empire-trajectory/scripts/staircase-enforcer.py check --verdict DOWNGRADE
python .claude/skills/business/empire-trajectory/scripts/staircase-enforcer.py check --verdict DOWNGRADE --force
```

### Compound Dashboard
```bash
python .claude/skills/business/empire-trajectory/scripts/compound-dashboard.py generate
```

## Asset Categories

| Category | Examples |
|----------|----------|
| code | Repos, tools, SaaS products, templates, scripts |
| audience | Followers, email list, community members |
| data | Training data, customer insights, market intelligence |
| relationship | Clients, partners, mentors, network contacts |
| revenue | MRR, ARR, recurring contracts |

## Staircase

| Stair | MRR | Strategy | DOWNGRADE Allowed |
|-------|-----|----------|-------------------|
| 0 | $0 | Validate | Yes |
| 1 | $1-3K | Cash bridge | Yes |
| 2 | $3-10K | Product revenue | No |
| 3 | $10-30K | Scale | No |
| 4 | $30-50K | Diversify | No |
| 5 | $50-100K | Empire | No |

## Integration

- **compound-filter.py** (transaction-layer) produces PASS/DOWNGRADE/KILL
- **staircase-enforcer.py** gates DOWNGRADE based on current stair
- **compound-dashboard.py** generates weekly report with gap analysis
- **asset-registry-cli.py** tracks all assets feeding into dashboard

## Data

- `data/empire/assets.db` — SQLite (3 tables: assets, staircase_log, compound_snapshots)
- `data/empire/staircase-state.json` — Current stair + definition
- `data/empire/reports/` — Weekly compound dashboard markdown reports
